1. You don't use shops to BUY things. They try to cheat you, you cheat
them!
2. You don't get artifacts (well, almost none) by killing monsters
(unless you find an altar and sacrifice a LOT of them, but this
increases your food problem). If you want artifacts, sacrifice or pray.
3. Again, to decrease your food problem, pray (but not too often).
4. Shopkeepers ARE unfreindly, as mentioned above.
5. If you're below max HP 50, and above AC 0, don't bother for the
Gnomish Mines. If you are on a level with two down starcases and pick
the wrong one, go back immediately and return there later.


